<navigation-bar title="谋马超博弈" back="{{true}}" color="black" background="#FFF"></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="page-shell" scroll-y type="list">
  <view class="header-card">
    <view class="header-top">
      <view>
        <text class="card-title">谋马超 · 铁骑谋弈</text>
        <text class="card-desc">本页只做谋马超一方决策：选出招即可；目标的策应（出阵迎战 / 拱卫中军）由对方当场公布，对照技能须知判定攻城成败。</text>
      </view>
      <button class="clear-btn {{clearBtnDisabled ? 'clear-btn--disabled' : ''}}" bind:tap="handleClear">清空</button>
    </view>
    <view class="status-chips">
      <text class="chip-primary">你的出招：{{selectedAttackLabel}}</text>
      <text class="chip">目标策应 · 对方公布</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">技能效果须知</text>
      <text class="chip">提示词</text>
    </view>
    <text class="section-desc">铁骑谋弈的触发、成败规则与收益，出招前先看一遍。</text>
    <view class="rules-list">
      <view wx:for="{{skillRules}}" wx:key="title" class="rule-item">
        <view class="rule-icon">
          <text class="rule-icon-text">{{item.icon}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="rule-body">
          <text class="rule-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="rule-text">{{item.text}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">你的出招</text>
      <text class="chip">谋马超方</text>
    </view>
    <text class="section-desc">从两策中挑一项；胜负等对方公布策应后再对表。</text>
    <view class="attack-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{attackOptions}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="attack-btn attack-btn--{{item.tone}} {{selectedAttack === item.id ? 'attack-btn--selected' : ''}}"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bind:tap="handleSelectAttack"
      >
        <view class="attack-btn-head">
          <text class="attack-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="attack-tone">{{item.toneLabel}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="attack-reward">{{item.reward}}</text>
        <text class="attack-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{selectedAttack !== null}}" class="hint-card">
    <text class="hint-title">出招对照（对方公布后判定）</text>
    <text class="hint-line hint-line--win">{{attackHintWin}}</text>
    <text class="hint-line hint-line--lose">{{attackHintLose}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <text class="section-title">博弈要点</text>
    <view class="tips-list">
      <view class="tip-item">
        <text class="tip-text">目标手牌或装备越关键，越可能拱卫中军防夺牌，此时出「扰阵疲敌」反而稳定摸两张。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="tip-item">
        <text class="tip-text">对方若好斗、习惯出阵正面硬拼，则「直取敌营」更容易得手——前提是你预判得准。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="tip-item">
        <text class="tip-text">谋弈没有必胜解：胜负全在预判对方当下的防守偏好，随机出招等于把收益交给运气。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="summary-card">
    <text wx:if="{{selectedAttack === 'strike'}}" class="summary-text">
      已选「直取敌营」：对方公布出阵迎战 → 攻城成功，获得其一张牌；公布拱卫中军 → 攻城失败。
    </text>
    <text wx:elif="{{selectedAttack === 'harass'}}" class="summary-text">
      已选「扰阵疲敌」：对方公布拱卫中军 → 攻城成功，你摸两张牌；公布出阵迎战 → 攻城失败。
    </text>
    <text wx:else class="summary-text">
      尚未出招。先想好这一刀要拿牌（直取敌营）还是补牌（扰阵疲敌），再猜目标会怎么防。
    </text>
  </view>
</scroll-view>